//
// One operator range of each yolo26n block kind on NPU2 against the numpy
// oracle, on seeded synthetic weights and a random image (no checkpoint
// needed): stem and C3k2, SPPF's pools, SPPF's cv2 and C2PSA, a neck stage,
// a Detect level and the postprocess.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
// REQUIRES: makefile_examples
//
// RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% make -f %S/Makefile BUILD=%t run_blocks_synthetic | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: yolo26n blocks: 6/6 PASS
